for the poisson,

p + (1-p) (F(y) - F(0))

when it should be, obiviously,

p + (1-p) (F(y) - F(0))/(1-F(0))

I cannot understand I made that mistake...

well, its often a minor correction, but if you correct for 0.5*cpo, you
would have seen at a value got negative, which cannot be....

H

