Adding control.inla = list(reordering="metis")) works perfectly with complete data that I have (n=82195) with the original model I posted and also with its expansions like:

v2<-inla(l1 ~ f(otacka.s1,sin1,model="rw1",constr=FALSE)+f(otacka.c1,cos1,model="rw1",constr=FALSE)+
